From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 14:55:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: Encode G16 render Works into heap buffers

submit_render_pool kept the TA and 3D Work encodings (0x940 and 0xcc0
bytes) on its stack, returned by value through Option and moved, so
each existed in the frame two or three times. Have the encoders fill
caller-provided buffers and allocate them from the heap per submission.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
